  "goodToKnow": "Der Luftraum is airspace: den Luftraum überwachen, sperren, verletzen. German airspace is controlled by the Deutsche Flugsicherung (DFS) in Langen near Frankfurt. In 2010, the eruption of Iceland's Eyjafjallajökull closed much of European airspace, including Germany's, for days. Drones near airports frequently cause short closures. Plural: die Lufträume."
